msgid "Typically, those with this attribute are helper characters\nwho heroically try to support their senpai despite being\nweaker and less experienced than the protagonist.\n\n……there's unmistakably no mirror in BB's My Room.\n\n             ◆\n\nAccording to BB, she calls #FAMILY #GIVEN\nher \"Senpai\" because of this SG.\nWhether she's younger or even a student is doubtful,\nbut BB's tone is definitely of a kouhai with her senpai.\nIf it had to be said, she's:\n\"an all-powerful kouhai (but seriously wicked).\"\n\nWhatever the case, a kouhai that blasts\n#FAMILY #GIVEN 'til they're against a wall\nwith her own SG can't really be called heroic anyway.\n"
